OL,3,GNEWSA'Horror' after man finds hundreds
OL,4,Aof letters found dumped in country road
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation after "hundreds" of
OL,8,Fundelivered letters were "discarded" on
OL,9,Fa country road.
OL,11,FAn estimated 400 unopened letters were
OL,12,Fhanded in to a Northern Ireland
OL,13,Fassembly member's office after being
OL,14,Ffound "dumped" several miles outside
OL,15,FLondonderry, on Wednesday.
OL,17,FMark H Durkan was contacted by a member
OL,18,Fof the public who was on the Mobuoy
OL,19,FRoad and found a bag, which he opened
OL,20,Fand "to his horror" they contained
OL,21,F"hundreds of items of unopened mail" of
OL,22,Fa personal nature.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
