OL,3,GNEWSA'Horror' after man finds hundreds
OL,4,Aof letters found dumped in country road
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany were bundled together with elastic
OL,7,Fbands and included correspondence from
OL,8,Fhealth trusts and banks to addresses in
OL,9,Fthe Derry area.
